  <relatedmaterial id="aspace_d23d8e60c680062f8808121ef3b17376">
    <head>Related Materials</head>
<p>Brooklyn, N.Y., Department of Law, Corporation Counsel records (2013.015)</p><p>Jacob Brenner papers (2006.023)</p><p>Brooklyn Bar Association folders in the Brooklyn Historical Society ephemera collection (ARC.272) and the Records of the Brooklyn Council for Social Planning (BCMS.0039)</p><p>Various images of Bar Association members and officers in the Brooklyn Daily Eagle photographs (BCMS.0002)</p><p>Images of the Association's building in the Brooklyn location scouting photographs collection (CBHM.0017)</p>  </relatedmaterial>
  <scopecontent id="aspace_b038ec15b9b81c215b2b26aef87d3d7f">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>The bulk of this collection is comprised of issues of Brooklyn Barrister, the Association's monthly publication. Brooklyn Barrister contains programs of monthly meetings, reports from committees, and articles on legal decisions and new statutes. Also included are the organization's constitution and bylaws, programs and table assignments for events, and a centennial journal.</p>  </scopecontent>
